# State & Context

Providers wrap the app from `app/_layout.tsx`:

- `providers/sql.tsx` — database access and live queries for settings and sessions
- `providers/formatter.tsx` — date and duration formatting
- `providers/warning_modal.tsx` — warnings and confirmations
- `providers/subscription.tsx` — RevenueCat lifetime access and the free session limit

Format dates and durations through `providers/formatter` before rendering them.

When surfacing an error, use a title from `constants/errors.ts`:

- Short Breath! — bad user input
- Lost the Line! — read or query failures
- Off the Line! — navigation errors
- Broke the Surface! — unexpected failures
- Unexpected Drop! — SQL errors
